{"3950890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mole or Not", "steam_appid": 3950890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏜️ Welcome to Mole or Not!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a suspicious saloon in the Wild West, where every player could be hiding the truth. Mole or Not is a <strong>multiplayer social deduction party game</strong> for <strong>4–5 players</strong> filled with bluffing, laughter and clever thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950890/extras/eceb78e1fa68b3862ec735ae37fc5b69.poster.avif?t=1759752755\" width=712 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950890/extras/eceb78e1fa68b3862ec735ae37fc5b69.webm?t=1759752755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950890/extras/eceb78e1fa68b3862ec735ae37fc5b69.mp4?t=1759752755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 How to Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can jump straight into the action with <strong>Quick Match</strong> to instantly join random players online, or set up a <strong>Friends Lobby</strong> to create a private room and play only with your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > After choosing your Wild West character and taking your seat at the table, the game begins with the selection of a category—such as <strong>Daily Life, Sports, Animals, Jobs, or Food</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the category is chosen, every player (the detectives) secretly receives the same word.  However, one player is given a slightly different but related word. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This player becomes <strong>the Mole</strong>, whose goal is to blend in, avoid suspicion, and survive without being exposed. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of saying their word out loud, players must <strong>choose objects from the environment</strong> to describe or hint at it indirectly. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The challenge for the detectives is to share just enough to prove they know the word, while still making it hard for the Mole to guess and adapt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Through careful discussion, observation, and deduction, the group must work together to identify who the Mole really is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950890/extras/8137f3fb990f3bda45628841df55e360.poster.avif?t=1759752755\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950890/extras/8137f3fb990f3bda45628841df55e360.webm?t=1759752755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950890/extras/8137f3fb990f3bda45628841df55e360.mp4?t=1759752755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕵️ The Deduction Phase</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, players take turns selecting an <strong>object</strong> that reminds them of their word.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detectives</strong> try to use the clues to identify the Mole.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Mole</strong> tries to guess the detectives’ real word, and pick fitting objects to stay hidden.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the round, all players <strong>vote</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detectives win if they expose the Mole.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mole wins by blending in and surviving.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950890/extras/079be7c59a6f81645675b566fced2681.poster.avif?t=1759752755\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950890/extras/079be7c59a6f81645675b566fced2681.webm?t=1759752755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950890/extras/079be7c59a6f81645675b566fced2681.mp4?t=1759752755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤠 Why You’ll Love Mole or Not</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ Fast rounds for <strong>4–6 players</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵️ Exciting <strong>social t</strong>with bluffing and mind games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎲 Unique <strong>object-based clue system</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😂 Fun, unpredictable discussions every round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 Play <strong>Quick Match</strong> online or create a <strong>lobby with friends</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 Colorful, stylized Wild West visuals</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950890/extras/04cf5411518fb681874e6eeabecd454f.poster.avif?t=1759752755\" width=534 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950890/extras/04cf5411518fb681874e6eeabecd454f.webm?t=1759752755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950890/extras/04cf5411518fb681874e6eeabecd454f.mp4?t=1759752755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌟 Are You the Mole… or the Detective?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Mole or Not, every game is full of <strong>suspicion, laughter and mind tricks</strong>.<br>Will you catch the traitor hiding among you, or fool everyone at the table?</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏜️ Welcome to Mole or Not!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a suspicious saloon in the Wild West, where every player could be hiding the truth. Mole or Not is a <strong>multiplayer social deduction party game</strong> for <strong>4–5 players</strong> filled with bluffing, laughter and clever thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950890/extras/eceb78e1fa68b3862ec735ae37fc5b69.poster.avif?t=1759752755\" width=712 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950890/extras/eceb78e1fa68b3862ec735ae37fc5b69.webm?t=1759752755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950890/extras/eceb78e1fa68b3862ec735ae37fc5b69.mp4?t=1759752755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 How to Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can jump straight into the action with <strong>Quick Match</strong> to instantly join random players online, or set up a <strong>Friends Lobby</strong> to create a private room and play only with your friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > After choosing your Wild West character and taking your seat at the table, the game begins with the selection of a category—such as <strong>Daily Life, Sports, Animals, Jobs, or Food</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the category is chosen, every player (the detectives) secretly receives the same word.  However, one player is given a slightly different but related word. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This player becomes <strong>the Mole</strong>, whose goal is to blend in, avoid suspicion, and survive without being exposed. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead of saying their word out loud, players must <strong>choose objects from the environment</strong> to describe or hint at it indirectly. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The challenge for the detectives is to share just enough to prove they know the word, while still making it hard for the Mole to guess and adapt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Through careful discussion, observation, and deduction, the group must work together to identify who the Mole really is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950890/extras/8137f3fb990f3bda45628841df55e360.poster.avif?t=1759752755\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950890/extras/8137f3fb990f3bda45628841df55e360.webm?t=1759752755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950890/extras/8137f3fb990f3bda45628841df55e360.mp4?t=1759752755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕵️ The Deduction Phase</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, players take turns selecting an <strong>object</strong> that reminds them of their word.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detectives</strong> try to use the clues to identify the Mole.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Mole</strong> tries to guess the detectives’ real word, and pick fitting objects to stay hidden.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of the round, all players <strong>vote</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detectives win if they expose the Mole.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mole wins by blending in and surviving.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950890/extras/079be7c59a6f81645675b566fced2681.poster.avif?t=1759752755\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950890/extras/079be7c59a6f81645675b566fced2681.webm?t=1759752755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950890/extras/079be7c59a6f81645675b566fced2681.mp4?t=1759752755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤠 Why You’ll Love Mole or Not</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚡ Fast rounds for <strong>4–6 players</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕵️ Exciting <strong>social t</strong>with bluffing and mind games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎲 Unique <strong>object-based clue system</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >😂 Fun, unpredictable discussions every round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 Play <strong>Quick Match</strong> online or create a <strong>lobby with friends</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 Colorful, stylized Wild West visuals</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span c